@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-11: AI Configuration and Health Check (WF-26)
|Sub Admin|
start
:Open AI configuration page;
|System|
:Show current settings and service status;
|Sub Admin|
:Set Ollama connection, model settings,\nRAG settings and service availability;
|System|
:Validate input;
:Run health check on AI service;
if (Ollama answers and model installed?) then (yes)
  :Save configuration;
  :Log configuration change;
else (no)
  :Reject change and show error;
endif
|Sub Admin|
:Monitor AI service errors and performance;
|System|
if (AI service disabled or unreachable?) then (yes)
  :AI actions show unavailable message;
  :Rest of platform keeps working;
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
